abstract: >
  The Open Encyclopedia System (OES) is a modular and
  configurable software for creating, publishing and
  maintaining online encyclopedias in the humanities and
  social sciences that are accessible worldwide via Open
  Access. OES adds a web-based open source software for
  article-based publication formats to already available
  options for electronic publishing.
